  "generateUi": {
    "summary": "Render the public agent-ops cockpit by mounting AgentOpsCockpit from @enregla-ui/duly-ui. Do not invent a parallel layout with raw colors.",
    "packageName": "@enregla-ui/duly-ui",
    "styles": [
      "@enregla-ui/duly-ui/styles.css",
      "@enregla-ui/duly-ui/reset.css"
    ],
    "themeAttribute": "data-theme=\"cockpit\"",
    "composition": [
      "AgentOpsCockpit",
      "AgentMetricRow",
      "AgentMetric",
      "RunTimeline",
      "HumanInterruptQueue",
      "GuardrailIndicator",
      "TokenCostMeter",
      "TraceLog"
    ],
    "example": "import \"@enregla-ui/duly-ui/styles.css\";\nimport \"@enregla-ui/duly-ui/reset.css\";\nimport { AgentOpsCockpit, CopyProvider } from \"@enregla-ui/duly-ui\";\n\nexport function Demo() {\n  return (\n    <CopyProvider locale=\"en\">\n      <div data-theme=\"cockpit\" lang=\"en\">\n        <AgentOpsCockpit />\n      </div>\n    </CopyProvider>\n  );\n}",
    "emission": {
      "summary": "When an agent must emit a screen, return a version 1 generative UI document. Do not emit HTML, CSS, or raw colors. Call get_generative_ui_schema, then validate_generative_ui, and keep the audit next to the model log. The host renders that document with GenerativeUiView. AgentOpsCockpit is the hand-built reference of the same cockpit.",
      "schemaTool": "get_generative_ui_schema",
      "validateTool": "validate_generative_ui",
      "host": "GenerativeUiView",
      "example": "packages/ui/src/agentic/cockpit.generative.json"
    },
    "accessibility": [
      "Set data-theme on an ancestor so semantic tokens resolve. The cockpit story uses cockpit.",
      "Use token utilities (text-ink, bg-surface-2, border-border-subtle, text-ok, text-warn, text-block). Do not write hex or rgb colors in component code.",
      "Status is never color alone. NodeStatusBadge, GuardrailIndicator, TraceLog.Row, and approval actions already include text or an icon with a text label.",
      "Give the page one h1. Name sections with headings or aria-label.",
      "Approval rows are buttons. Reach them with Tab, expand with Enter, then activate Approve, Reject, or Escalate with the keyboard.",
      "A block-risk approval asks for a second confirmation before it commits. Do not remove that step.",
      "Leave focus outlines on the ring token. Do not set outline: none without a replacement.",
      "Motion tokens collapse under prefers-reduced-motion. Do not add a custom animation that ignores that.",
      "The cockpit sets lang=\"en\" because its sample copy is English."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "This server returns tokens, a curated component inventory, composition instructions, and a structural check of generative UI documents. It does not render React, call a model, or attach to a live agent runtime.",
      "validate_generative_ui is a structural check. Duly does not store, sign, or certify the audit. It is not a SOC 2 report, an ISO certificate, or a bank attestation.",
      "The inventory is a hand-maintained list of agent-ops components and a few primitives. It is not every export in @enregla-ui/duly-ui, and it does not include prop types. Read the TypeScript source for props.",
      "Hex values are the CSS fallback. The oklch field is parsed from the theme stylesheet, which is what supporting browsers use.",
      "AgentOpsCockpit shows fictional sample operations. Approve, reject, and escalate update local component state only.",
      "There is no hosted demo URL in this repo. Run Storybook or the showcase locally."
    ]
  },
  "generativeUi": {
    "version": "1",
    "tools": [
      "get_generative_ui_schema",
      "validate_generative_ui"
    ],
    "components": [
      "Section",
      "Stack",
      "AgentMetricRow",
      "AgentMetric",
      "RunTimeline",
      "HumanInterruptQueue",
      "GuardrailIndicator",
      "TokenCostMeter",
      "TraceLog"
    ],
    "rules": [
      "document.version",
      "theme.known",
      "components.allow_list",
      "props.no_raw_color",
      "props.no_style_escape",
      "a11y.text_labels",
      "a11y.status_enum",
      "a11y.single_title",
      "audit.stable_ids",
      "approval.no_skip_confirm"
    ],
    "example": "packages/ui/src/agentic/cockpit.generative.json",
    "host": "GenerativeUiView from @enregla-ui/duly-ui",
    "audit": "validate_generative_ui checks structure only and returns the same audit for the same document. Duly does not store, sign, or certify it. It is not a SOC 2 report, an ISO certificate, or a bank attestation."
  },
  "catalog": {
    "catalogId": "duly://catalog/v1",
    "version": "1",
    "components": [
      "Column",
      "ApprovalGate",
      "AuditLog",
      "RichToolCall",
      "TokenCost",
      "Guardrail"
    ],
    "package": "@duly/catalog"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Regenerate packages/mcp/design-system.json with pnpm --filter @duly/mcp export after token or generative-UI contract changes.",
    "The component list is curated. Prop types live in packages/ui/src.",
    "Generative UI audits are structural. Duly does not store, sign, or certify them."
  ]
}
